@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Decree 67/2023/NĐ-CP ("Nghị định số 67/2023/NĐ-CP"), Chapter II Section 1: compulsory insurance
-- of motor vehicle owners' civil liability, in both vintages (as made; as amended by Decree
-- 220/2026/NĐ-CP).
-- THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every other module imports this one.
--
-- Sources (NOTES.md §0 and encoding.json give url and sha256):
--   src:N                         line N of ../../source/raw/nd67-congbao-1017-1018.txt
--   src:nd67-congbao-1019-1020:N  line N of ../../source/raw/nd67-congbao-1019-1020.txt
--   src:nd220-2026-congbao-367:N  line N of ../../source/raw/nd220-2026-congbao-367.txt
-- Every `src:` line is printed by tools/vnsrc.py from that line; none is typed by hand.
--
-- Money is Vietnamese đồng (VND), a bare NUMBER. Rates are percent figures as the source
-- prints them (6 means 6%), unless a name says "share" (a fraction from 0 to 1).
-- Membership test: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to each fact, or a
-- certificate, a registration, a police or medical record or a court decision records it.
-- Whether a fact makes compensation payable is a rule, in the module for that Article.

§ `Nouns for the compulsory motor vehicle owners' civil liability insurance`

§§ `The vintage, and the rules that govern a contract`

-- Decree 67/2023 is in force from the day it was signed, 6 September 2023:
-- src:16 | Số: 67/2023/NĐ-CP Hà Nội, ngày 06 tháng 9 năm 2023
-- src:2009 | 1. Nghị định này có hiệu lực thi hành kể từ ngày ký ban hành.
-- Decree 220/2026 is in force from 1 July 2026:
-- src:nd220-2026-congbao-367:195 | 1. Nghị định này có hiệu lực thi hành từ ngày 01 tháng 7 năm 2026.
DECLARE `A vintage of Decree 67/2023` IS ONE OF
    `Decree 67/2023 as made`
    `Decree 67/2023 as amended by Decree 220/2026`

-- Which rules govern a contract is decided by its date of conclusion and by any amendment the
-- parties agreed (Article 76(1) of Decree 67; Article 10(2) of Decree 220): see
-- nd67-ch1-general.l4. A contract concluded before Decree 67 continues under the rules Article
-- 76(1) names (the Law on Insurance Business, Decree 03/2021/NĐ-CP and others), which are not
-- in this encoding's sources.
DECLARE `The rules that govern a contract` IS ONE OF
    `Decree 67/2023, in the vintage` HAS `vintage` IS A `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
    `the rules Article 76(1) continues for a contract concluded before Decree 67/2023`

§§ `The motor vehicle`

-- The premium classes of Annex I (Phụ lục I), section by section. A class carries the one
-- figure the table keys on (cylinder capacity, seats, payload). Which class a vehicle is in
-- is a fact of its registration; the Annex defines none of its class names, and Article 6
-- defines its vehicle kinds by reference to the Road Traffic Law (NOTES.md, fork F3).
-- src:2051 | I Mô tô 2 bánh
-- src:2052 | 1 Dưới 50 cc 55.000
-- src:2053 | 2 Từ 50 cc trở lên 60.000
-- src:2054 | II Mô tô 3 bánh 290.000
-- src:2055 | Xe gắn máy (bao gồm xe máy điện) và các loại
-- src:2056 | III
-- src:2057 | xe cơ giới tương tự
-- src:2058 | 1 Xe máy điện 55.000
-- src:2059 | 2 Các loại xe còn lại 290.000
-- src:2060 | IV Xe ô tô không kinh doanh vận tải
-- src:2066 | V Xe ô tô kinh doanh vận tải
-- src:2095 | VI Xe ô tô chở hàng (xe tải)
DECLARE `A vehicle class in Annex I` IS ONE OF
    `a two-wheeled motorcycle`                      HAS `cylinder capacity in cc` IS A NUMBER     -- I
    `a three-wheeled motorcycle`                                                                  -- II
    `an electric moped`                                                                           -- III.1
    `another moped or similar motor vehicle`                                                      -- III.2
    `a car not used for transport business`          HAS `number of seats` IS A NUMBER            -- IV.1-4
    `a pickup or minivan not used for transport business`                                         -- IV.5
    `a car used for transport business`              HAS `number of registered seats` IS A NUMBER -- V.1-22
    `a pickup or minivan used for transport business`                                             -- V.23
    `a goods vehicle (truck)`                        HAS `payload in tonnes` IS A NUMBER          -- VI
    `a driving-school vehicle`                       HAS `the vehicle of the same type` IS A `A vehicle class in Annex I` -- VII.1
    `a taxi`                                         HAS `number of registered seats` IS A NUMBER -- VII.2
    `an ambulance`                                                                                -- VII.3(a)
    `a cash-in-transit vehicle`                                                                   -- VII.3(b)
    `another special-purpose car`                    HAS `designed payload in tonnes` IS A MAYBE NUMBER -- VII.3(c)
    `a tractor unit with its trailer`                                                             -- VII.4
    `a tractor with its trailer`                                                                  -- VII.5
    `a bus`                                          HAS `number of seats` IS A NUMBER            -- VII.6

-- `beyond its service life under the law`: Article 4(5)(a), the insurer may refuse to sell.
-- The three Article 9(1) facts that permit a term under 1 year.
-- `a driving licence is required to drive it`: the qualifier at the end of Article 7(2)(c);
-- which vehicles need a licence is a matter of the Road Traffic Law, not of this decree.
DECLARE `A motor vehicle` HAS
    `class in Annex I`                                                         IS A `A vehicle class in Annex I`
    `beyond its service life under the law`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `a foreign vehicle temporarily imported for re-export, in traffic in Vietnam for less than 1 year` IS A BOOLEAN
    `remaining service life under the law of less than 1 year`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `subject to temporary registration`                                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `a driving licence is required to drive it`                                IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `The contract and its certificate`

-- `amended by agreement to apply`: NOTHING where the parties agreed no amendment; otherwise
-- the vintage the amendment brought the contract under (Article 76(1); Decree 220 Article 10(2)).
-- `aligned with the owner's first contract of the year`: Article 9(2), several vehicles of one
-- owner brought to one renewal date, so that this term ends with that first contract.
DECLARE `A contract of compulsory motor insurance` HAS
    `concluded on`                                     IS A DATE
    `insurance begins on`                              IS A DATE
    `insurance ends on`                                IS A DATE
    `the premium paid`                                 IS A NUMBER
    `the vehicle`                                      IS A `A motor vehicle`
    `amended by agreement to apply`                    IS A MAYBE `A vintage of Decree 67/2023`
    `aligned with the owner's first contract of the year` IS A BOOLEAN

-- The particulars Article 10(2) requires on the certificate, one field per point:
-- src:266 | 2. Giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm do doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm chủ động thiết kế và
-- src:267 | phải bao gồm các nội dung sau đây:
-- src:268 | a) Tên, địa chỉ, số điện thoại (nếu có) của chủ xe cơ giới.
-- src:269 | b) Biển số xe và số khung, số máy.
-- src:270 | c) Loại xe, trọng tải, số chỗ, mục đích sử dụng đối với xe ô tô.
-- src:271 | d) Tên, địa chỉ, số điện thoại đường dây nóng của doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm.
-- src:274 | đ) Giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo hiểm đối với người thứ ba.
-- src:275 | e) Trách nhiệm của chủ xe cơ giới, người lái xe khi xảy ra tai nạn.
-- src:276 | g) Thời hạn bảo hiểm, phí bảo hiểm, thời hạn thanh toán phí bảo hiểm.
-- src:277 | h) Ngày, tháng, năm cấp Giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm.
-- src:278 | i) Mã số, mã vạch được đăng ký, quản lý và sử dụng theo quy định của pháp
-- src:279 | luật để lưu trữ, chuyển tải và truy xuất thông tin định danh doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm
-- src:280 | và định danh sản phẩm bảo hiểm bắt buộc trách nhiệm dân sự của chủ xe cơ giới.
DECLARE `A certificate of insurance` HAS
    `(a) name, address and telephone number if any of the owner`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `(b) plate number, chassis number and engine number`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `(c) for a car: type, payload, seats and purpose of use`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `(d) name, address and hotline number of the insurer`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `(dd) the limit of liability to third parties`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `(e) the duties of the owner and the driver when an accident happens`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `(g) the term, the premium and the premium payment deadline`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `(h) the date of issue`                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `(i) a registered code and barcode identifying the insurer and the product` IS A BOOLEAN
    `issued for a car`                                                         IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `The accident`

-- An item of property damaged in the accident, with the facts Article 7(2)(d), (e) and (g)
-- turn on. `the actual damage` is in VND (Article 12(6)(b): actual damage).
DECLARE `An item of damaged property` HAS
    `the actual damage`                                                         IS A NUMBER
    `stolen or robbed in the accident`                                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `special property: gold, silver, precious stones, valuable papers such as money, antiques, rare paintings, a body or remains` IS A BOOLEAN
    `an indirect consequence: loss of commercial value, or loss tied to the use and exploitation of the damaged property` IS A BOOLEAN

-- The classes of the acuity table of section VIII of Annex VI (the axis labels of the table).
-- src:nd67-congbao-1019-1020:1993 | Giao điểm của 2 trục tung - trục hoành là tỷ lệ % tổn thương cơ thể chung của
-- src:nd67-congbao-1019-1020:1994 | 2 mắt do giảm thị lực (sau khi đã được chỉnh kính). Thị lực của mỗi mắt được biểu
-- src:nd67-congbao-1019-1020:1995 | diễn trên 1 trục (trục tung hoặc trục hoành) phân ra các độ 8/10 - 10/10 (bình
-- src:nd67-congbao-1019-1020:1996 | thường), 7/10 - 6/10 (giảm rất nhẹ), 5/10, 4/10... đến sáng - tối (ST) âm tính. Thị
-- src:nd67-congbao-1019-1020:1997 | lực đếm ngón tay 3m trở xuống được coi là mù.
DECLARE `A visual acuity class` IS ONE OF
    `8/10 to 10/10`
    `6/10 to 7/10`
    `5/10`
    `4/10`
    `3/10`
    `2/10`
    `1/10`
    `1/20`
    `below 1/20`
    `no light perception`

-- A limb, and a sex: two notes of Annex VI fix the point within a band by them
-- (section I, notes after items 4.2.16 and 6.3.8).
DECLARE `A limb` IS ONE OF `an upper limb`, `a lower limb`
DECLARE `A sex` IS ONE OF `female`, `male`

-- An injury, in the forms Annex VI provides for it.
-- * `an item of Annex VI`: the row, as part and section ("A", "B.I" ... "B.X") and item number as
--   printed ("4.2.9"); `assessed rate` is the percent the medical assessment fixed within the
--   row's band (NOTHING if none has); `limb` and `sex` serve the two notes above.
-- * `reduced visual acuity of both eyes, by the acuity table`: the two axes of that table.
-- * `stiffness of the joints of a digit, special case 1`: "Những trường hợp đặc biệt" 1 pays
--   50% of the payment for the loss of that digit; the row named is that loss row.
-- * `the loss of the only remaining eye, special case 3`.
-- * `an injury not listed in Annex VI, special case 5`: rated by comparison with listed ones or
--   by the conclusion of the Medical Assessment Council (Hội đồng giám định y khoa).
DECLARE `An injury` IS ONE OF
    `an item of Annex VI` HAS
        `part and section`        IS A STRING
        `item`                    IS A STRING
        `assessed rate`           IS A MAYBE NUMBER
        `limb`                    IS A MAYBE `A limb`
        `sex`                     IS A MAYBE `A sex`
        `an addition the row describes applies` IS A BOOLEAN
    `reduced visual acuity of both eyes, by the acuity table` HAS
        `acuity of one eye`       IS A `A visual acuity class`
        `acuity of the other eye` IS A `A visual acuity class`
    `stiffness of the joints of a digit, special case 1` HAS
        `the digit is a thumb, an index finger or a big toe` IS A BOOLEAN
        `part and section of the loss row` IS A STRING
        `item of the loss row`    IS A STRING
        `assessed rate of the loss row` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `the loss of the only remaining eye, special case 3`
    `an injury not listed in Annex VI, special case 5` HAS
        `rate fixed by comparison or by the Medical Assessment Council` IS A MAYBE NUMBER

-- A person harmed in the accident. The first five fields are the facts the definition of the
-- third party (Article 3(5)(a)) and the scope (Article 7(1)) turn on; they are checkboxes,
-- not one role, because a person can be several of them at once (an owner riding as a
-- passenger). The two amounts are those Article 12(6)(a) names: an agreement between the
-- insured and the injured person (or heir or representative), and a court decision.
-- `unidentified, or without a lawful heir` and the burial costs serve special case 6.
DECLARE `A person harmed in the accident` HAS
    `driving the vehicle`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `on the vehicle`                                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `a passenger on the vehicle`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the owner of the vehicle`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `acted intentionally to cause the damage`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `died`                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `injuries`                                                IS A LIST OF `An injury`
    `damaged property`                                        IS A LIST OF `An item of damaged property`
    `amount agreed with the insured for health and life`      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `amount fixed by a court decision for health and life`    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `unidentified, or without a lawful heir`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `actual necessary costs of burial and of keeping the remains to trace identity` IS A NUMBER

-- The accident. Article 3(2)-(3) define when a vehicle is operating or in road traffic; Article
-- 7(2) lists the exclusions, one field per fact it turns on. `the owner's share of the fault`
-- is a fraction from 0 to 1 (Article 12(6)(a), second paragraph, and (b)).
-- src:78 | 2. Xe cơ giới hoạt động là xe cơ giới đang vận hành gồm di chuyển, dừng xe,
-- src:79 | đỗ xe có sự điều khiển của chủ xe cơ giới hoặc người lái xe.
-- src:80 | 3. Xe cơ giới tham gia giao thông là việc chủ xe cơ giới hoặc người lái xe điều
-- src:81 | khiển xe cơ giới tham gia giao thông đường bộ.
DECLARE `An accident` HAS
    `date of the accident`                                                         IS A DATE
    `the vehicle was participating in road traffic`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the vehicle was moving, stopped or parked`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the vehicle was under the control of its owner or a driver`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the owner had handed possession and use of the vehicle to another`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the owner or the driver acted intentionally to cause the damage`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver who caused it deliberately fled`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver who fled had performed the owner's civil liability`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver did not meet the age condition of the Road Traffic Law`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver had no driving licence`                                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver used an invalid driving licence`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver's licence was erased or altered`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver's licence had expired at the time of the accident`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver used a licence not matching the vehicle`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver's right to use the licence was suspended for a term, or the licence was revoked` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver's blood or breath alcohol exceeded the normal level in the Ministry of Health guidance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the driver had used drugs or banned stimulants`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `caused by war, terrorism or an earthquake`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `an authority found it caused entirely by the fault of a third party`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `several motor vehicles caused it`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the owner's share of the fault`                                                IS A NUMBER
    `the persons harmed`                                                            IS A LIST OF `A person harmed in the accident`

§§ `The claim`

-- What is known when the Article 12(3) advance falls due. The injury rate there is an
-- ESTIMATE ("ước tính"), in percent.
-- src:317 | 3. Trong vòng 3 ngày làm việc kể từ ngày nhận được thông báo của bên mua
-- src:318 | bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm về vụ tai nạn, doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm phải tạm
-- src:319 | ứng bồi thường đối với thiệt hại về sức khỏe, tính mạng, cụ thể:
-- src:320 | a) Trường hợp đã xác định được vụ tai nạn thuộc phạm vi bồi thường thiệt hại:
-- src:321 | 70% mức bồi thường bảo hiểm ước tính theo quy định cho một người trong
-- src:322 | một vụ tai nạn đối với trường hợp tử vong.
-- src:323 | 50% mức bồi thường bảo hiểm ước tính theo quy định cho một người trong
-- src:324 | một vụ tai nạn đối với trường hợp tổn thương bộ phận.
-- src:325 | b) Trường hợp chưa xác định được vụ tai nạn thuộc phạm vi bồi thường
-- src:326 | thiệt hại:
-- src:327 | 30% giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo hiểm theo quy định cho một người trong một vụ
-- src:328 | tai nạn đối với trường hợp tử vong và ước tính tỷ lệ tổn thương từ 81% trở lên.
-- src:329 | 10% giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo hiểm theo quy định cho một người trong một vụ
-- src:330 | tai nạn đối với trường hợp ước tính tỷ lệ tổn thương từ 31% đến dưới 81%.
DECLARE `The harm, as estimated for the advance` IS ONE OF
    `death`
    `a brain injury leaving a persistent vegetative state`
    `a partial injury` HAS `estimated injury rate` IS A NUMBER

-- The documents of the claim file, one field per document Article 13 lists.
-- src:404 | 1. Văn bản yêu cầu bồi thường.
DECLARE `A claim file` HAS
    `(1) the written request for compensation`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `(2)(a) the vehicle registration certificate, or a document Article 13(2)(a) accepts instead` IS A BOOLEAN
    `(2)(b) the driving licence`                                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `(2)(c) the driver's identity card, citizen identity card, passport or other identity paper` IS A BOOLEAN
    `(2)(d) the insurance certificate`                                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `(3)(a) the injury certificate`                                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `(3)(b) the medical record`                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `(3)(c) the death extract, death notice, police confirmation or forensic result` IS A BOOLEAN
    `(4)(a) invoices, vouchers or evidence of the repair or replacement`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `(4)(b) papers on the costs the owner incurred to limit the loss or on the insurer's instructions` IS A BOOLEAN
    `(5) the police documents on the accident`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `(6) the insurer's assessment record`                                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `(7) the court decision`                                                       IS A BOOLEAN

-- The kind of claim, which decides which of those documents the file needs.
DECLARE `A kind of claim` HAS
    `for harm to health or life`                                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `a victim died`                                                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `for damage to property`                                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `a third party or a passenger died, or it must be verified that the accident was entirely a third party's fault` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a court decision exists`                                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the insurer repaired or made good the damage itself`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the owner incurred costs to limit the loss or on the insurer's instructions`  IS A BOOLEAN

-- Who must gather a document (Article 13, last paragraph).
DECLARE `A party to the claim` IS ONE OF
    `the insurer`
    `the insurance buyer or the insured`
    `the injured person`
    `the vehicle owner`

-- A working-day calendar. The decree counts some periods in working days ("ngày làm việc")
-- and does not say which days those are (NOTES.md, fork F14). This encoding takes Saturdays and
-- Sundays as non-working and the caller supplies every other day off (public holidays).
DECLARE `A working-day calendar` HAS
    `days off other than Saturdays and Sundays` IS A LIST OF DATE

-- The acts of the regulative rules of Articles 10(1) and 12 (nd67-art12-duties-*.l4).
DECLARE `An act under Articles 10 and 12` IS ONE OF
    `notify the insurer's hotline at once`
    `move, dismantle or repair the damaged property without the insurer's consent`
    `gather and provide the claim documents that are the buyer's to gather`
    `help the insurer verify the documents provided`
    `guide the buyer on safety and on the claim file and procedure`
    `organise the loss assessment`
    `pay the advance on compensation`
    `send the written or electronic notice of the accident`
    `reduce the compensation for property by up to 5%`
    `inform the injured person of the amount the insurer paid`
    `notify the amount of compensation, and pay it`
    `ask in writing for a new certificate to replace a lost one`

§§ `Results and problems`

-- A band of payment in VND: the least and the most a row of Annex VI pays.
DECLARE `A payment band` HAS
    `least` IS A NUMBER
    `most`  IS A NUMBER

-- The answer to "is this harm covered?", named for the provision that gives it.
DECLARE `The answer on cover` IS ONE OF
    `covered`
    `outside the scope: the vehicle was neither in road traffic nor operating`
    `outside the scope: the person is neither a third party nor a passenger`
    `outside the scope: a passenger's property is not covered`
    `excluded: an intentional act of the owner or the driver`
    `excluded: an intentional act of the injured person`
    `excluded: the driver fled without performing the owner's civil liability`
    `excluded: the driver's age or licence`
    `excluded: an indirect consequence`
    `excluded: alcohol or drugs, for damage to property`
    `excluded: property stolen or robbed in the accident`
    `excluded: special property`
    `excluded: war, terrorism or an earthquake`

-- What Article 12(9) makes of one of several contracts concluded for the same vehicle.
-- The advance on compensation under Article 12(3): an amount, or none of the cases it lists.
DECLARE `The advance under Article 12(3)` IS ONE OF
    `an advance of` HAS `amount` IS A NUMBER
    `none of the cases Article 12(3) lists`

DECLARE `What Article 12(9) does with a contract` IS ONE OF
    `this is the contract that pays`
    `this contract does not pay, and its premium is refunded in full` HAS `refund` IS A NUMBER

-- Invalid input, rejected rather than answered (EITHER, left side): the caller can fix it.
DECLARE `A problem with the facts` IS ONE OF
    `the item is not in Annex VI`
    `the item fixes no rate of its own`
    `the assessed rate lies outside the band of the item`
    `a share of fault is not between 0 and 1`
    `the premium adjustment exceeds 15% of the Annex I premium`
    `the reduction exceeds 5% of the compensation for property`
    `Article 12(7) gives no ground for a reduction`
    `a cylinder capacity, a number of seats or a payload is not a positive number`
    `the vehicle named for Annex I section VII.1 is not in section IV or VI`
    `the insurance ends before it begins`
    `the day of revocation is outside the term of the insurance`
    `special case 1 does not apply to a thumb, an index finger or a big toe`

§§ `The rows of Annex VI`

-- The cell of the "%" column of a row of Annex VI: a band "a - b" (a single figure n is the band
-- n to n), or nothing, where the row is a heading or its text sends the assessor elsewhere.
DECLARE `Annex VI rate` IS ONE OF
    `a band of`          HAS `lowest percent` IS A NUMBER, `highest percent` IS A NUMBER
    `no rate of its own`

-- A row of Annex VI, positional: (part and section, item number as printed, rate).
DECLARE `An Annex VI row` HAS
    `part and section` IS A STRING
    `item`             IS A STRING
    `rate`             IS AN `Annex VI rate`

-- A row of the acuity table, positional: the acuity of one eye, then the rate (percent) for
-- each acuity of the other eye, in the order the table prints its columns.
DECLARE `An acuity table row` HAS
    `acuity of one eye`                  IS A `A visual acuity class`
    `with the other eye at 8/10 to 10/10` IS A NUMBER
    `with the other eye at 6/10 to 7/10`  IS A NUMBER
    `with the other eye at 5/10`          IS A NUMBER
    `with the other eye at 4/10`          IS A NUMBER
    `with the other eye at 3/10`          IS A NUMBER
    `with the other eye at 2/10`          IS A NUMBER
    `with the other eye at 1/10`          IS A NUMBER
    `with the other eye at 1/20`          IS A NUMBER
    `with the other eye below 1/20`       IS A NUMBER
    `with the other eye at no light perception` IS A NUMBER
